    - pari-elldata
    - pari-galpol
    - ppl-dev
    - pynac (>= 0.7.26-5)
    - python3-sphinx (>= 3.0)
    - python3-tk
    - yasm
  * Remove (Build-)Depends:
    - libblas-dev
    - python3-brial (>= 1.2.5-2)
  * New patches:
